<% set_page_meta title: "Contact", description: "Start a conversation with SPEERD about light, fabrication, or an ambitious object." %>

<main id="main-content">
  <header class="contact-hero accent--spectacle">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>Bring the strange idea.</h1>
    <p>I’m interested in LED installations, instrument collaborations, unusual fabrication problems, and projects that need more than one kind of making.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="contact-details" aria-labelledby="contact-details-title">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Good starting points</p>
      <h2 id="contact-details-title">Tell me what it should feel like.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Useful first messages include the object or space, the people using it, the rough timeline, and what success looks like. Sketches and improbable references are welcome.</p>
      <p class="contact-hold"><strong>Contact route pending:</strong> the public address is intentionally not published until it is confirmed. For now, use the channel that brought you here.</p>
      <%= link_to "Explore the work", galleries_path, class: "button-link button-link--dark" %>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
